    "issue": "Worker nodes are placed in public subnets",
    "risk": "Using concat(module.subnets.private_subnet_ids, module.subnets.public_subnet_ids) allows EKS managed resources and potentially node placement in public subnets, increasing exposure of worker nodes to the internet and raising the risk of direct network attack or unintended public reachability.",
    "remediation": "Change module.eks_cluster.subnet_ids to use only private subnets: subnet_ids = module.subnets.private_subnet_ids."
