    "resource": "module.eks_cluster",
    "issue": "Kubernetes API access allowed from entire VPC CIDR",
    "risk": "Setting allowed_cidr_blocks = [module.vpc.vpc_cidr_block] permits API server access from any resource in the VPC, broadening the attack surface and enabling lateral movement from any compromised instance in the VPC.",
    "remediation": "Restrict module.eks_cluster.allowed_cidr_blocks to only trusted administrative CIDRs, or remove it if not required. Replace allowed_cidr_blocks = [module.vpc.vpc_cidr_block] with a minimal list such as allowed_cidr_blocks = var.admin_cidr_blocks."
  },
